UID:event-hotel-hospitality-expo@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260708T101026Z
DTSTART:20260913T130000Z
DTEND:20260915T190000Z
SUMMARY:Hotel & Hospitality Expo
DESCRIPTION:Hotel & Hospitality Expo Saudi Arabia takes place in Riyadh from 13–15 September 2026 at the Riyadh Front Exhibition & Conference Center\, bringing together leading local and international brands with some of the Kingdom’s most influential buyers across the hotel and hospitality sector. As Saudi Arabia’s tourism and travel growth accelerates in line with Vision 2030\, the expo offers a prime platform to build partnerships\, discover the latest trends and technologies\, and connect with global exhibitors and designers. Visitors can explore a comprehensive range of solutions covering hospitality interiors\, operating supplies and equipment\, HoReCa and food services\, cleaning and hygiene\, hospitality technology\, hotel services\, and wellness (gyms\, recreation\, spa\, and sports). Inquire Now
LOCATION:Riyadh Front Exhibition & Conference Center
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-hotel-hospitality-expo.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-saudi-international-falcons-hunting-exhibition@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260708T101026Z
DTSTART:20261001T110000Z
DTEND:20261010T190000Z
SUMMARY:Saudi International Falcons & Hunting Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:The Saudi International Falcons and Hunting Exhibition is one of the largest events dedicated to falconry and hunting in Saudi and globally. It brings together everything related to falconry and outdoor excursions\, from falcons and hunting tools to equipment and gear associated with hunting trips\, all within a comprehensive space that allows visitors to explore this field in one place. The exhibition also features platforms showcasing a wide range of brands\, alongside accompanying activities and events suitable for families\, creating an experience that blends cultural and entertainment elements. The event plays an important role in preserving falconry heritage and raising awareness by offering content that introduces visitors to its history and significance within Saudi’s cultural identity.
LOCATION:Riyadh
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-saudi-international-falcons-hunting-exhibition.html
END:VEVENT
